  "bodyHash": "fa18d243cef583f1",
  "content": "\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#236fa1\">Incendium-Translation-Fix</span> <span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">需要</span> <span style=\"color:#843fa1\"><a style=\"color:#843fa1\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/incendium\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Incendium</a></span> 和 <span style=\"color:#843fa1\"><a style=\"color:#843fa1\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fsparkles\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sparkle</a></span> 作为依赖项。</strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#236fa1\">Incendium-Translation-Fix</span> 实际上是一个以 <span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\">模组</span> 形式打包的 <span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\">数据包</span>，旨在 <span style=\"color:#e67e23\">修复</span> <span style=\"color:#843fa1\">Incendium</span> 中存在的 <span style=\"color:#ba372a\">翻译</span> <span style=\"color:#ba372a\">错误</span>。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>它还 <span style=\"color:#e67e23\">修复</span> 了 <span style=\"color:#ba372a\">哨兵之怒在玩家获得后立即损坏的漏洞</span> &mdash; 它被 <span style=\"color:#ba372a\">错误地</span> 当作已在磨石上使用过处理。 <span style=\"color:#bfedd2\">现在你可以正常使用该物品了</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#bfedd2\">！</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong>它还 <span style=\"color:#e67e23\">修复</span> 了 <span style=\"color:#ba372a\">远程射击未命中后火风暴暂时无法使用的漏洞</span>&mdash;<span style=\"color:#bfedd2\">现在火风暴才真正名副其实！</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong>它还将 <span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\">下界的高度上限</span> 提高到了 <span style=\"color:#f8cac6\">1024</span> 格。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>它应该 <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">兼容</span> <span style=\"color:#169179\">所有支持</span> <span style=\"color:#843fa1\">Incendium</span> 的 <span style=\"color:#169179\">版本</span> <span style=\"color:#eccafa\">（我尚未全部测试，因此如果你遇到任何问题，欢迎随时反馈）。</span></strong><span style=\"color:#f8cac6\">&lt;事实上，它目前仅支持 Minecraft 1.19 及以上版本。&gt;</span></p>\n<p><strong>以下是受影响的物品 <span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\">（包含中文翻译示例）</span>：</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong>诸神黄昏</strong></span></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_dfc460eb-df15-4da4-ae5d-e11218cd99e6.png\" alt=\"诸神黄昏\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong>破晓者</strong></span></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_30a4180c-93de-467f-b82d-34dc575f15aa.png\" alt=\"破晓者\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong>哨兵之怒</strong></span></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_e5f3cbb3-caf2-44b0-9831-691549dce92d.png\" alt=\"哨兵之怒\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong>凋零克星</strong></span></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_4087a184-364c-41ce-8320-addf87903b9d.png\" alt=\"凋零克星\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong>伏特三叉戟</strong></span></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_c6eb7c99-4b64-4cab-8773-060dcdbf402b.png\" alt=\"伏特三叉戟\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong>重型镐</strong></span></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_4f238554-9c60-4b1d-ac85-acffaae03bee.png\" alt=\"重型十字镐\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong>多重十字弩</strong></span></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_de5f281b-5ff0-4e36-8ce9-f74ec1bb3692.png\" alt=\"多重十字弩\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong>炽燃战斧</strong></span></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_cec47e1a-9ae3-4416-8406-ccd70aec9d60.png\" alt=\"炽燃战斧\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong>可疑药水</strong></span></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_276c7b29-fc00-4235-94a0-67bc1c580d54.png\" alt=\"可疑药水\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">注意： </span>本模组<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">不提供任何翻译内容</span> &mdash; 所有<span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\">翻译素材</span>均来源于<span style=\"color:#843fa1\"><a style=\"color:#843fa1\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fsparkles\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sparkle</a></span>！</strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">注意：</span> 本模组对<span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">已获得的物品</span> <span style=\"color:#ba372a\">不会生效</span>！</strong></p>\n<p><strong>本模组<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">未获得</span> <span style=\"color:#843fa1\">Incendium</span> <span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">的官方授权</span>。<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">若构成侵权，请联系我！</span></strong></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
